+- Seed LIC is more affected by aliasing than Fast LIC due to fewer calculated voxels, resulting in a less smooth appearance [S1, S2].
+- Convolution can cause field lines to merge into bundles if seed points are too close; a minimum distance between initial seed points must be enforced [S1, S2].
